cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the associated manuscript and this software."
title: "RatKpContext: software for tissue-context GNN evaluation in rat Kp prediction"
abstract: "Model definitions, training and evaluation pipelines, frozen configurations, statistical analysis, DVI output propagation, matched-panel construction, and figure generation for a study of tissue-context effects in graph neural networks for rat tissue-to-plasma partition coefficient (Kp) prediction."
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-09"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Pluswick/RKpC-Benchmark"
url: "https://github.com/Pluswick/RKpC-Benchmark"
keywords:
  - graph neural network
  - tissue-to-plasma partition coefficient
  - physiologically based pharmacokinetic modeling
  - molecular property prediction
  - reproducibility
